   "text": "Every UX workflow, end to end: request \u2192 AI review \u2192 Customer Need \u2192 decision \u2192 delivery \u2192 customer tracking \u2192 validation / rework.\nRoutes in brackets are the screens. Customers only ever see public Need fields, their own company's tickets and customer-visible updates.",
